  "text": "INNO3D GEFORCE GTX 1630 TWIN X2 OC | Inno3D - Graphics Cards\nSkip to main content\nImage\nNEWS\nPRODUCTS\nGRAPHICS CARDS\niCHILL\nImage\nINNO3D\nImage\nENTERPRISE\nGPU\nRTX 50 Series\nImage\nRTX 40 Series\nImage\nRTX 30 Series\nImage\nGTX Series\nImage\nGT Series\nImage\nSUPPORT\nSOFTWARE\nINSTALLATION GUIDES\nSUPPORT FORM\n註冊延長保固\nWHERE TO BUY\nREDEMPTION\nABOUT\nABOUT INNO3D\nCONTACT US\nPRIVACY POLICY\nNEWS\nPRODUCTS\nGRAPHICS CARDS\niCHILL\nImage\nINNO3D\nImage\nENTERPRISE\nGPU\nRTX 50 Series\nImage\nRTX 40 Series\nImage\nRTX 30 Series\nImage\nGTX Series\nImage\nGT Series\nImage\nSUPPORT\nSOFTWARE\nINSTALLATION GUIDES\nSUPPORT FORM\n註冊延長保固\nWHERE TO BUY\nREDEMPTION\nABOUT\nABOUT INNO3D\nCONTACT US\nPRIVACY POLICY\nBreadcrumb\nHome\nProduct\nN16302-04D6X-1177VA25\nTHE GAMING SUPER CHARGER\nINNO3D GEFORCE GTX 1630 TWIN X2 OC\nINNO3D GEFORCE GTX 1630 TWIN X2 OC\nKEY FEATURES\nSPECIFICATION\nPRODUCT IMAGES\nTHE GAMING SUPER CHARGER\nINNO3D introduces its new GeForce® GTX 1630 GDDR6 TWIN X2 OC and COMPACT. INNO3D has released different versions of the GTX 16 Series such as the GeForce GTX 1660 Ti, GTX 1660 and GTX 1650 - the GTX 1630 TWIN X2 OC and COMPACT adopts the same award-winning ‘Best-in-Class’ NVIDIA’s Turing™ architecture.\nThe INNO3D GeForce GTX 1630 TWIN X2 OC is factory overclocked out of the box while the COMPACT measures just 6.29 inches/160mm and is ready to fit most systems out there. The TWIN X2 OC is equipped with dual 8cm fans while the COMPACT comes with a single 10cm fan, pushing the boundaries of what our engineers could fit in while still confined to the standard card height.\nThe INNO3D GeForce GTX 1630 TWIN X2 OC and COMPACT memory configuration boasts 4GB of memory, GDDR6 with 64-bit running at 12Gbps. It is the best-in-class performance with the advanced graphics capabilities of the award-winning NVIDIA Turing architecture. It is a major upgrade of the core streaming multiprocessor to more efficiently handle the complex graphics of modern games.\nINNO3D Graphics Engine to read GPU clock, temperature, fan, speed, memory profiles, driver and BIOS version. You can change GPU and memory clock, fan speed, target power and temperature. In addition, it also features real time monitoring.\nFEATURES AND BENEFITS\nTURING SHADERS\nFeaturing concurrent execution of floating point and integer operations, adaptive shading technology, and a new unified memory architecture, Turing shaders enable greater performance on today’s games. Get improved power efficiency over the previous generation for a faster, cooler and quieter gaming experience.\nGEFORCE EXPERIENCE\nCapture and share videos, screenshots, and livestreams with friends. Keep your GeForce drivers up to date and optimize your game settings. GeForce Experience™ lets you do it all. It’s the essential companion to your GeForce graphics card.\nNVIDIA ANSEL\nThis powerful photo mode lets you take professional-grade photographs of your games like never before. Now, you can capture and share your most brilliant gaming experiences with super-resolution, 360-degree, HDR, and stereo photographs.\nMORE CREATING,\n\u0003LESS WAITING\nDedicated GPU power accelerates the creative apps you use every day. Combined with NVIDIA Studio Drivers, you’ll get optimized performance and reliability to supercharge your creativity. We’ll handle the tech so you can focus on your passion, creating.\nPrivacy Policy | Contact Us\n© 2022 NVIDIA Corporation. NVIDIA, the NVIDIA logo, GeForce, GeForce Experience, GeForce RTX, G-SYNC, NVLink, and ShadowPlay are registered trademarks and/or trademarks of NVIDIA Corporation in the United States and other countries. All other trademarks and copyrights are the property of their respective owners.\n© 2022 INNOVISION Multimedia Limited. All rights reserved. The INNO3D, INNO3D and iCHILL logo are the registered trademarks of INNOVISION Multimedia Ltd. in Asia, Europe and / or other countries. All other company and / or product names may be trademarks or registered trademarks of their respective owners.\n© 2018 Square Enix Limited. Developed by Eidoes Interactive Corporation. © 2017 Bethesda Softworks LLC, a ZeniMax Media company. All Rights Reserved. © 2018 Activision Publishing, Inc. ACTIVISION, CALL OF DUTY, CALL OF DUTY BLACK OPS, and the shield logo are trademarks of Activision Publishing, Inc.\nThe terms HDMI and HDMI High-Definition Multimedia Interface, and the HDMI Logo are trademarks or registered trademarks of HDMI Licensing Administrator, Inc.\nDatasheet:\nGPU Engine Specs\nGPU Engine Specs\nCUDA Cores\n512\nBoost Clock (MHz)\n1800 MHz\nBase Clock (MHz)\n1740 MHz\nThermal and Power Spec\nThermal and Power Spec\nMinimum System Power Requirement (W)\n300W\nSupplementary Power Connectors\nN/A\nMemory Specs\nMemory Specs\nMemory Clock\n12Gbps\nStandard Memory Config\n4GB\nMemory Interface\nGDDR6\nMemory Interface Width\n64-bit\nMemory Bandwidth (GB/sec)\n96\nFeature Support\nFeature Support\nNVIDIA Architecture\nTuring\nMicrosoft DirectX\n12 Ultimate\nNVIDIA DLSS\nYes\nNVIDIA GeForce Experience\nYes\nNVIDIA Ansel\nYes\nNVIDIA FreeStyle\nYes\nBus Support\nPCI-E 3.0 X16\nNVIDIA ShadowPlay\nYes\nOS Certification\nWindows 10, Linux, FreeBSDx86\nNVIDIA Highlights\nYes\nNVIDIA G-SYNC™-Ready\nYes\nGame Ready Drivers\nYes\nNVIDIA Studio Drivers\nYes\nNVIDIA GPU Boost™\nYes\nVulkan API\nYes\nOpenGL\n4.6\nNVIDIA Encoder\n6th Generation\nNVIDIA Decoder\n4th Generation\nAccessories\nAccessories\nInstallation Guide\nYes\nPower Guide\nYes\nGraphics Card Dimensions:\nGraphics Card Dimensions\nLength\n196mm\nHeight\n113mm\nWidth\n2-slot\nDisplay Support\nDisplay Support\nMulti Monitor\nYes\nMaxmium Digital Resolution\n7680x4320\nHDCP\n2.2\nStandard Display Connectors\nHDMI 2.0b, 2x DisplayPort 1.4\nTOP\nNEWSLETTER\nGet the latest news and more.\nLeave this field blank\nNEWS\nPRODUCTS\nGRAPHICS CARDS\niCHILL\nImage\nINNO3D\nImage\nENTERPRISE\nGPU\nRTX 50 Series\nImage\nRTX 40 Series\nImage\nRTX 30 Series\nImag